---
globs: backend/**/*.py
alwaysApply: false
---

- Use typed Pydantic models at API boundaries.
- Keep security decisions in deterministic code under `app/policy.py`.
- Treat `UNTRUSTED -> SECRET -> EXTERNAL_WRITE` as the core prohibited flow when the destination is not authorized.
- Never store a raw secret in event arguments or logs.
- The upload tool must write only to `MockCollector`; no HTTP call is permitted in the local runner.
- Every behavioural change requires a focused pytest.
- Preserve local fallback behaviour when adding optional integrations.
